cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "DriftWatch: malware-detector lifetime under label delay, a fixed analyst budget and conformal drift monitoring"
abstract: >-
  Research software and a pre-registered study. One time-aware protocol
  (TESSERACT constraints C1-C3, reported with AUT and A-AUT) is applied to
  pre-extracted LAMDA (Android) and BODMAS (Windows PE) feature files to
  measure how label delay, a fixed analyst budget, conformal sample selection
  and drift monitors change a malware detector's useful lifetime. No malware
  sample is downloaded, executed or redistributed.
